# Aggregate LifeBoard/ + Packages/ string-catalog snapshot. Intentional key or
# translation changes require updating this file in the same reviewed change.
#
# 2026-08-23, the optional Power-Up phase: 1092 -> 1111. Xcode extracted these
# on build; the catalog was not hand-edited.
#
# Additions are the Calendar/Health/EVA primer, chooser, sync-receipt and
# summary copy. The removals are the reveal's Cloud EVA card, which moved out of
# core entirely - "Cloud EVA with Luna", "EVA MAY ALSO USE", the Cloudflare
# processing sentence, and "Cloud setup will resume safely in EVA. %@". Those
# strings have no remaining call site.
#
# "Step %@ of %@, %@" is replaced rather than removed: the progress bar now
# speaks two vocabularies, so VoiceOver says "Core setup, step 3 of 6, Life
# areas" or "Power up, step 1 of 3, Calendar" - an optional phase must not be
# announced as a continuation of a mandatory one.

# 2026-09-09, Home's collapsed Health signal + the streamlined onboarding and
# health-connection copy: 1111 -> 1138. Xcode extracted these on build; the
# catalog was not hand-edited.
#
# Only one addition belongs to the Home change: "Connect\nHealth", the label on
# the tile that replaces a row of dashed permission rings when two or more
# Health signals were never shared. It is line-broken in the source because the
# signal row gives each slot about a third of the screen.
#
# The remaining 26 are the streamlined LifeWeave journey, the health read/write
# split ("This connection only reads data...", "These switches control writing
# only..."), the Apple Health recovery path ("Review access in Apple Health",
# "Open the Health app, tap your profile..."), and the EVA cloud context
# disclosures. Those shipped in the commits already on master; their catalog
# regeneration had not been folded in, so it lands here.

